WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:37.540
Infiltration

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.040
Damn!

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.960
Who's there? The enemy!

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:42.960
Get him!

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.460
Don't let him go!

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.500
Stop!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.130
There he is!

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.170
Get him!

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.380
After him!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.420
Captain.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.710
That was close, sir.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.880
Shako, it's you!

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:06.920
I knew you would be the one who'd come for me!

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.000
Are you all right?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.710
Haven't eaten or slept in three days.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.880
Chirico! Have you seen Chirico?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.920
They went to attack the palace.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:24.330
That bastard...! Wants the PS all for himself!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.920
I won't let him!

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:29.420
I... won't... let... him...

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.330
You're awake?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.880
General! Where am I?

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.580
The base. You damned fool!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.420
How could you let him get the female PS?

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:01.250
I couldn't help it, sir.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.380
But... but we know where he is now.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.380
We have to hit him as fast as we can...!

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.130
Don't you understand yet?

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:13.380
We want him to attack and then we'll get
the PS when we arrive to mop up!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.040
Yes, sir. But we have to move soon.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.250
The palace is too far to hit from here!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.670
I have news for you!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.880
The government forces are nearly
in control of all of Kummen!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.330
They're... They're what?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.250
It'll be over soon.

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:34.710
All I have to do is wait for Chirico
to open a hole into the palace.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:14.380
This is the armory. C&C is over here.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:16.710
Over here is the heliport.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:20.540
I was in the palace for a while,
but this is all I ever saw of it.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.540
That's fine.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:26.170
From what I saw before
their main force consists of ATs.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.960
Sure there isn't any other
major weaponry in there?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:33.710
Come on! They musta had something more
to have fought this war!

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.210
It's me.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.960
How's it look?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.170
This retreat's for real.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.540
Probably concentrating their forces
to protect the palace.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:58.500
It's a trick. The Veela wouldn't give up this easy!

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:05.210
Whatever it is, we have to deal with
the Veela ahead of us now.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:08.830
This is the shortest way there, huh?

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.250
What should we do?

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:13.750
We're going to become guerillas ourselves.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:22.790
Unit 8, fallback complete!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.880
Unit 3, fallback complete!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.710
Unit 6, fallback complete!

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.830
Unit 5, fallback complete!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:29.830
Your Highness.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:33.830
Changing the plans like this
has thrown our troops into chaos.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:38.210
The commanders are objecting to it
and the troops are scared and worried.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.210
Gentlemen, there is no reason to worry.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.420
Now, shall we get back to work?

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.040
They're ordering us to pull back!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.710
We don't have a commander to give us that order!

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:00.960
There's a division retreating
one kilometer from here.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.290
Join up with them!

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.880
Why do we have to pull back?

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.670
Our guys aren't losing that bad!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.880
The prince doesn't want to fight anymore!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.210
After everything, he's still one of the royals!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:13.540
As soon as the war turns bad,
he could care less about us!

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:15.710
God dammit!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.080
Serves him right!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.170
Anyone who insults the prince
will end up like that!

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:27.290
Monica!

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:30.210
All right, then let's follow orders and retreat!

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:32.000
At least we'll stay alive!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.670
If you guys don't wanna die, then come with me!

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:37.170
You others can join up with another unit!

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:38.000
Come on!

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.750
Here they come. Four of them.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.080
What are you doing there? Move it!

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:48.130
The enemy! Send help!

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.710
Where? What's your position?

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.330
Their friends are coming. Get in their machines!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.540
What happened? Sneak attack?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.210
It's the enemy! What are you waiting for?

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:34.750
Is it over?

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.330
Yeah, pretty much.

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:43.250
All right, move out!

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:36.920
Are we gonna lose?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.380
Yeah. Say goodbye to the Holy Kingdom.

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:44.540
So why'd we even bother fighting?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.670
I hear the officers have been dismissed.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.130
I guess the prince has just given up.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:51.460
God dammit!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.920
How could he...? How could he?

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.540
Where are you?

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:04.170
Where are you, Majesty?

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.040
Majesty!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:14.670
Highness, the retreat will be
completed in one hour.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.630
And the enemy's movements?

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:20.290
None. They haven't yet
taken advantage of our actions.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:21.540
I see...

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.290
I need some rest.

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:50.380
Don't you understand? She's turned against us!

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:52.330
Headquarters agrees with me.

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:55.460
If I kill Chirico, it will snap her out of this.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.920
Let me go out!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.250
What? While the prince's retreat is underway?

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.330
While the prince's retreat is underway?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.580
Your new personal AT from
headquarters is on its way.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.880
Once we have it, you can fight all you want!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:08.710
But, sir...

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.080
That's an order!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:41.880
I suppose you don't want your valuable weapon
getting hurt simply for Kummen's war?

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:46.380
Highness, Ypsilon is the final trump card
in the palace's defense.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:50.920
And I'm grateful for it. But I have no hope left.

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:56.750
Defeatism doesn't suit a man who believes in
the future of the Holy Kingdom of Kummen.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.880
But your commanders say there's
a good chance you'll be defeated

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.920
if you continue with your current plans.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:04.960
Defeat?

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.130
Yes, Majesty.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.130
Then perhaps that is Holy Kummen's goal!

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:14.580
Defeat. Then death. Not only for me.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.880
All the soldiers who fought
in this uprising will die.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:23.000
I've called them back here
so that they will die with me.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.880
You want them to die uselessly?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:28.580
You may see it that way, but I do not.

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.580
We will lose.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.790
All the old ways will be destroyed.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:38.790
And when the winds blow away
the ashes of the fires of war...

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.290
Only then can Kummen truly be reborn anew.

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:48.040
Just as you used Kummen's war
as a laboratory for your PS,

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:52.630
perhaps I, too, was using it
to conduct my own experiment.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:54.830
How could you?

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:56.750
Who's there?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.080
Your Highness!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.040
That's all this was...?

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.380
How could you...?

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.750
How could you?!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.830
We're almost there.
Unload the ATs when we arrive.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.580
What the...? Stop! Stop!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.210
Stop or I'll shoot!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.080
My brakes are out.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.250
Who the hell are you? What's your name?

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:15.170
Chirico Cuvie.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.670
Can't you drive a little smoother, Chirico?

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:50.290
Intruder in sector 4!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.000
What? An assault team?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.040
Four ATs are headed for the palace!

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.710
All right, send out the palace defense forces!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.880
They're en route right now.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.420
It's Chirico! It has to be him!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.500
We still don't know that.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.080
She'll be with him, too!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.330
Where are you going?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:18.380
I have to see if it's him!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:19.380
Wait!

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:22.580
Your new AT will arrive soon.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.290
Don't move from here!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.130
They'll be waiting for us at the exit. Get ready!

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.170
Gotcha!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.210
Potaria, what are you doing?

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.000
The machine's getting in my way.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:21.250
I'm here for only one reason:
To kill Kanjelman!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:28.210
The enemy is inside the palace!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.170
Send out our AT units.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.080
Yes, sir!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.210
Wait! Stay here!

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.540
Where's Potaria?

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.330
Shit! Get him!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.500
Monica!

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.080
Who...?

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.960
Potaria! I...

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.710
Monica, get down!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.250
Monica!

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:17.290
Monica, hang on!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.210
Potaria...

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:26.210
The whole war was meaningless.

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:29.420
Kanjelman just wanted Kummen in chaos.

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:30.630
Don't try to talk!

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:35.580
He said the war was just some
big experiment for him.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.500
But... I'm glad I could see you... again...

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.580
Monica...

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.000
Monica! Monica!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.880
Monica! Monica!

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:51.420
Monica!

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:55.790
Monica...

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:07.330
Enemy helicopter force, five degrees to south.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.330
How many?

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:11.000
At least 30, Majesty. It's a major force.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.670
To all personnel!

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:25.380
Once we're down, hit all Veela around the palace!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.710
But do not enter the palace until ordered to!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:29.960
Take us down!

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.500
That wall there is the armory.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.710
All right.

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.500
Kiderra, we're going in!

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:45.960
Take care of the armory! I'm goin' after the base!

00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:46.960
Gotcha!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.000
The enemy has penetrated the armory!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.380
Do not engage them!

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.040
Repeat, the enemy has penetrated the armory!

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:05.500
Do not engage them!

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:07.830
Repeat, do not engage!

00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:15.420
Proto One!

00:22:15.420 --> 00:22:17.710
Mr. Borough, the helicopter's arrived.

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:20.750
Good. Your new machine is here!

00:22:33.420 --> 00:22:34.750
I'm all set.

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:50.080
There was no way of my knowing
at the time that the light I saw

00:22:50.080 --> 00:22:52.750
was a new custom AT made for Ypsilon.

00:22:54.630 --> 00:22:56.040
Next Episode

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:59.750
The age shifts and bends, finally breaking.

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:01.790
Ushered in by pounding waves.

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:03.750
Ushered in by howling winds.

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:06.710
In the depths of Kummen rages
a storm of madness and murder.

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:08.790
Tradition and convention are consumed in flames.

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:11.830
Swept like mud out to sea and into the past.

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:15.920
Tragedy builds upon tragedy
becoming first history and then legend.

00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:18.330
Next time, "Closing In"

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:22.080
Chirico is the wedge which splits history apart.

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.630
Closing In

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.630
Next Time

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:46.330
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.330 --> 00:23:49.880
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:56.250
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.750 --> 00:24:00.290
Whenever I'm alone

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:03.710
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:09.960
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:13.460
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.460 --> 00:24:16.880
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:23.380
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.750 --> 00:24:29.710
Brighter than any other light...
